{"type":"standard","title":"Sharice Davids","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sharice Davids</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q58322868","titles":{"canonical":"Sharice_Davids","normalized":"Sharice Davids","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sharice Davids</span></span>"},"pageid":58597443,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Sharice_Davids.jpg/330px-Sharice_Davids.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":495},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/Sharice_Davids.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2800,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374375221","tid":"8551dc7f-ae05-11f1-972e-9513a9e1f7bb","timestamp":"2026-09-11T17:23:36Z","description":"American politician and attorney (born 1980)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharice_Davids","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharice_Davids?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharice_Davids?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sharice_Davids"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharice_Davids","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Sharice_Davids","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharice_Davids?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sharice_Davids"}},"extract":"Sharice Lynnette Davids is an American politician, attorney, and former mixed martial artist serving as the U.S. representative from Kansas's 3rd congressional district since 2019. A member of the Democratic Party, she represents a district that includes most of the Kansas side of the Kansas City metropolitan area, including Kansas City, Overland Park, Prairie Village, Leawood, Lenexa, and Olathe.","extract_html":"<p><b>Sharice Lynnette Davids</b> is an American politician, attorney, and former mixed martial artist serving as the U.S. representative from Kansas's 3rd congressional district since 2019. A member of the Democratic Party, she represents a district that includes most of the Kansas side of the Kansas City metropolitan area, including Kansas City, Overland Park, Prairie Village, Leawood, Lenexa, and Olathe.</p>"}